. A speed stat determines whether your cards or the enemy's will be faster. Remember that you can't dodge what's already hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/4fe7d9f5e699386f2bbe93d70e1fac1e.poster.avif?t=1767018349\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/4fe7d9f5e699386f2bbe93d70e1fac1e.webm?t=1767018349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/4fe7d9f5e699386f2bbe93d70e1fac1e.mp4?t=1767018349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/eb5552b05276f251b921ea3e528b5091.avif?t=1767018349\" width=1055 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/fcf363cc5a6d407d03237226a9a8e55b.poster.avif?t=1767018349\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/fcf363cc5a6d407d03237226a9a8e55b.webm?t=1767018349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746360/extras/fcf363cc5a6d407d03237226a9a8e55b.mp4?t=1767018349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build a myriad of possible decks based on the choices you make throughout the run. From the stalwart and reliable Conquistador's gunpowder to the eldritch and unpredictable spells of the Scholar.</p><p cl